WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.248
Yes, you're welcome to bring it.

2
00:00:07.584 --> 00:00:13.704
Whether it's a partial or full hairpiece, bring whatever you're used to.

3
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:19.056
That said, some areas require a human-hair piece specifically.

4
00:00:19.392 --> 00:00:30.600
Since wedding-parent hair styling uses curling irons and blow dryers for volume, human hair is needed to withstand that heat without warping.
